<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1623) <span class="when">Oct 15, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Save Conform</b> in the Conform window and in the Pull Plates window: the conform goes into its sequence&#8217;s folder, as Pull Plates names it, without pulling a frame. The Conform window then says where it went (&#8220;Saved to RAI, 12:40&#8221;).</li>
<li><b>The Media menu in five groups.</b> The conform: Conform a Cut, Recall Conform, Save Conform to Sequence, Conform Window. Then what is done to the cut, a submenu per subject: Conformed Cut (report, export, joins and splits, Edit Ref, notes, clear), Camera Originals (Locate Media, Camera Folders, Develop Camera Raw), DaVinci Resolve (Verify Conform, Open Cut, Read Back). Then the plates: Pull Plates, Queue, Shots on Disk, Orphaned Plates. Then what adds to the playlist, and last finding, checking and optimizing media.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
